  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a name=\"top\"></a></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"> <p><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/u.gif\" width=\"24\">O. \n                            Combat&amp;Jobs</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:60%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"590\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background.gif\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_1/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">1써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_2/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">2써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_3/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">3써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_4/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">4써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_5/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">5써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_6/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">6써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_7/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">7써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_8/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">8써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l&nbsp;</font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_s/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">마법책만들기와 기초운용</font></a></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:20; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">\n                        &nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"560\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/poison.gif\" width=\"44\">POISON</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        : </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">In \n                                        Nox &nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지속시간 \n                                        : 즉시</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Nightshade</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : POISON은 목표물에 독을 거는 마법입니다. \n                                        독의 강도는 주문자의 메저리 스킬에 의해</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">결정되어지고 \n                                        메저리 스킬이 높을수록 더 강한&nbsp;독을 \n                                        걸 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">방어자는 독속성 \n                                        저항에 의해 \n                                        데미지 계산을 받게 됩니다. 몬스터중에는 \n                                        독에 대한 이뮨(독 무시)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이나 \n                                        혹은 강한 저항력을 가진 것들도 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\" width=\"540\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">계산공식 \n                                                    : 메저리 65이상은 레벨2의 \n                                                    독, 85이상은 레벨3의독을 \n                                                    주게되며 메저리 100일 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">경우 \n                                                    10%의 확율로 레벨4의 독으로 \n                                                    공격하게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/bless.gif\" width=\"44\">Bless</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        : </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Rel \n                                        Sanct &nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지속시간 \n                                        : (((이벨 / 5) + 1) * 6)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Garlic, Mandrake Root</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : Bless는 일시적으로 목표물의 Str,Dex,Int를 \n                                        올려줍니다. 이 효과는 주문자의 이벨이 \n                                        높을수록 수치가 증가됩니다. 낮은 이벨을 \n                                        가진 주문자가 먼저 블레스를 걸게되면 \n                                        다른 높은 이벨을 가진자의 블레스 주문은 \n                                        무시됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">또한 \n                                        효과지속시간 중 재시도를 하게되면 해당 \n                                        시간이 처음부터 다시 지속됩니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/magic_unlock.gif\" width=\"44\">Unlock</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        :</span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> Ex \n                                        Por &nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지속시간 \n                                        : 즉시</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Blood Moss, Sulphurous Ash</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Unlock은 \n                                        마법주문으로 닫혀있는 문이나 상자를 \n                                        열게 하는 마법입니다. 해당 마법은 메저리 \n                                        스킬에 의존하며 높은 스킬을 가질수록 \n                                        강한 마법으로 잠겨있는 상자를 열 수 \n                                        있게 됩니다. </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">보물상자는 \n                                        2레벨상자까지 열 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/fireball.gif\" width=\"44\">Fireball</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        : </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Vas Flam \n                                        &nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지속시간 \n                                        : 즉시</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Sulphurous Ash</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : Fireball은 매직애로우보다 강한 마법으로 \n                                        빠른 무준시전과 낮은 마나소비 다소 높은 \n                                        데미지를 주어&nbsp;목표물의 마무리 공격을 \n                                        할 때 유용하게 쓰입니다. 불속성 공격이므로 \n                                        당연히 방어자는 불속성 \n                                        저항에 의해 \n                                        데미지 계산을 받게 됩니다. 해당 마법은 \n                                        이벨과 인스크립션 스킬 향상을 통해 데미지가 \n                                        증가될 수 있습니다. </span></font><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_sp_2/\"><font color=\"teal\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>전투계산공식(스펠데미지)</b></font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">편 \n                                        참조</font></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/teleport.gif\" width=\"44\">Teleport</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        : </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Rel \n                                        Por &nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지속시간 \n                                        : 즉시</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Mandrake Root, Blood Moss</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : Teleport는 주문자가 장소이동을 순간적으로 \n                                        할 수 있는 마법입니다.(최대거리는</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">11타일) \n                                        이동할 장소는 같은 화면에 있어야 하며 \n                                        보이는 장소이어야만 합니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/magic_lock.gif\" width=\"44\">Magic \n                                        Lock</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        : </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">An \n                                        Por &nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지속시간 \n                                        : 매직언락으로 열릴때까지 지속</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Blood Moss, Garlic, Sulphurous \n                                        Ash</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : Magic Lock은 박스나 상자를 마법적인 \n                                        요소로 잠그는 것으로 오직 매직언락으로</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">해당 \n                                        잠금을 해제시킬 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/telekinesis.gif\" width=\"44\">Telekinesis</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        : </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Ort \n                                        Por Ylem &nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지속시간 \n                                        : 즉시</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Blood Moss, Mandrake Root</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : Telekinesis은 먼거리에 있는 아이템을 \n                                        사용하게 합니다. 예를 들면 먼거리에 \n                                        있는</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">문을 \n                                        열거나 닫을때, 트랩이 설치되어있는 보물상자를 \n                                        주문자의 피해없이 열때 사용됩니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/wall_of_stone.gif\" width=\"44\">Wall \n                                        of Stone</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        : </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">In \n                                        Sanct Ylem &nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지속시간 \n                                        : 10초</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Blood Moss, Garlic</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : Wall of Stone는 일시적으로 돌장벽을 \n                                        필드에 생성시키는 마법입니다. </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">좁은 \n                                        통로에서 유용하게 쓰이며 적의 추격을 \n                                        막을 수 있습니다. </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">해당 \n                                        돌장벽은 6써클 디스펠 마법, 5써클 디스펠필드로 제거 \n                                        할 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:20; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">\n<font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"29\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/Spellbook.gif\" width=\"26\"></b></span></font><font color=\"#003300\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>3Circle</b></span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(시전가능 \n                        메져리 : 10.1, 마나소비 : 9, 100%성공스킬수치 : </span></font><font color=\"#CC3300\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">50</span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">)</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"298\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:8;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_skill/\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/menu.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"295\">